  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Man, I never thought I’d need to use this!”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to cast spells, Int 13 or Character level 5th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may, upon beating the DC to identify a monster by 10 or more, elect to to spontaneously re-prepare a spell (or add a new spell to your list of spells known until it is used). You may use this ability a number of times per day equal to ½ your character level or ½ your Intelligence modifier, whichever is greater.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
